:: Pub Fame Favour
<<effects>>

<<if $pubfame.goal.includes("Raise") and ($fame[$pubfame.target] gte 2000 or $pubfame.target is "pregnancy" and $fame.pregnancy gte playerNormalPregnancyTotal() * 250)>>
